  "title-post": "How can you improve cash management in your bakery? The case of Tranché",
  "current-post-image-src": "/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/68d29891551c8d19d1fa5307_Screenshot%202025-09-15%20at%2016.47.07.avif",
  "current-post-image-sizes": "100vw",
  "current-post-image-srcset": "/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/68d29891551c8d19d1fa5307_Screenshot%202025-09-15%20at%2016.47.07-p-500.avif 500w, /assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/68d29891551c8d19d1fa5307_Screenshot%202025-09-15%20at%2016.47.07-p-800.avif 800w, /assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/68d29891551c8d19d1fa5307_Screenshot%202025-09-15%20at%2016.47.07-p-1080.avif 1080w, /assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/68d29891551c8d19d1fa5307_Screenshot%202025-09-15%20at%2016.47.07.avif 1200w",
  "company-logo-style": "background-image:url(\"/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/682e3eaf409d73e1da421395_images.avif\")",
  "title-post-2": "How can you improve cash management in your bakery? The case of Tranché",
  "rt-blog-html": "\n          <figure style=\"padding-bottom:56.206088992974244%\" class=\"w-richtext-align-fullwidth w-richtext-figure-type-video\">\n            <div>\n              <iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/-jSicjESgOE\" title=\"20 to 30% of sales in cash: the real challenge for the Tranché bakery\" scrolling=\"no\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"true\"></iframe>\n            </div>\n          </figure>\n          <p>‍</p>\n          <p>Marie and Augustin, founders of Tranché, had a simple ambition: to modernize the neighborhood bakery, without ever abandoning traditional methods. A rare balance, but essential if passion and performance are to be combined.</p>\n          <blockquote>\"Tranché was born of our passion for craftsmanship and our desire to shake up the bakery codes a little.\"</blockquote>\n          <p>With four stores and more on the way, they have made a key choice: to rely on technology to drive their growth.</p>\n          <h3>30% of sales... in cash</h3>\n          <p>What many people don't know is that in a bakery, the bank card doesn't reign supreme. At Tranché, between 20% and 30% of sales are still made in cash. A nightmare to manage for those who want to have a clear vision of margins.</p>\n          <blockquote>\"The <a href=\"/en/automated-cash-recycling-system\">coiner</a> has become essential. Without it, mistakes are made, time is wasted, and there's a lot of uncertainty.\"</blockquote>\n          <h3>Technology as a silent lever</h3>\n          <p>Marie and Augustin aren't geeks, but they know that the key to lasting success is to have the right tools. Their <a href=\"/en/restaurant-touch-cash-register\">cash register</a>? Connected to their accounting, HR and ERP systems. Their sales? Tracked in real time. Their margins? Calculated, controlled and corrected.</p>\n          <p>Behind the scenes, it's Innovorder that structures this management. An integrated solution, to be sure. But above all, a partner who understands the realities of the field.</p>\n          <h3>Growing without losing focus</h3>\n          <p>What Tranché wants to prove is that it's possible to be a demanding craftsman and a seasoned entrepreneur. That technology, far from dehumanizing, allows you to spend more time on what's essential: the product, the team, the customer.</p>\n          <p>\"Being a modern craftsman means not being afraid to get help from tech.\"</p>\n          <h3>-</h3>\n          <p>Would you like to equip your <a href=\"/en/bakery\">bakery</a>? Call in an Innovorder expert and find out how to streamline checkout!</p>\n        ",
  "right-head": "Sliced",
  "bozzolo-cat": "Franchise",
